Rewards
    Give 7500000 experience
    Give 10000 coins
    Give 1 of 900196000

direction_27 = location "Hornet" about "Hornet\nReferred to as Hell`s Bees; inhabits plains; powerful venom can kill humans with one sting" found "El Morad" karus at 1383 1110 elmorad at 607 991 in zone 2
direction_545 = location "Hornet" about "Hornet\nReferred to as Hell`s Bees; inhabits plains; powerful venom can kill humans with one sting" found "Karus" karus at 1091 1600 elmorad at 607 991 in zone 1

On available
    Say "Master, there's a request from the Traders. Get to [Sailor] Hayes at the port."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "How are you? I am [Sailor] Hayes."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The captain told me that you will help us from now on. Hmm. let's find out what you got. Now first, get me [Adonis Specialty Honey] from [Hornet]! I heard it's very precious. Make sure you get it.\n\n[Hornet] in accordance with the request of Karus Regional Executive pugeo port sailors and yes, bring in specially made honey from Adonis."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "How are you? I am [Sailor] Haine."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The captain told me that you will help us from now on. Hmm. let's find out what you got. Now first, get me [Adonis Specialty Honey] from [Hornet]! I heard it's very precious. Make sure you get it.\n\nUpon request of Aladdin and Local Rod Elmo Sharks captain of the port, from the Hornet bring in specially made honey Adonis."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "You don't have enough. I still need more."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_545
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You don't have enough. I still need more."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_27

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Very nice. Thank you.  This sure is top of quality. Let me ask you for another favor.\n\nOh, let me just ask you to do [Sailor] Armada's delivery work. He is busy and reckless. Let see..please deliver this [Specialty Honey Box] to Shaymer, the [Merchant of Moradon] of Luperson Castle. Oh, and don't forget to bring me the receipt."
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Very nice. Thank you.  This sure is top of quality. Let me ask you for another favor.\n\nOh, let me just ask you to do [Crewman] Kidd's delivery work. He is busy and reckless. Let see..Please deliver this [Specialty Honey Box] to Clark, the [Merchant of Moradon] of El Morad Castle. Oh, and don't forget to bring me the receipt."
